<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_af7940c5-8780-4587-810d-c55a4cee389c"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_46a4d8a9-511d-4165-84dc-921fc47a0607"
id="sec.3-def.financialyear"><b><i>financial year</i></b></defterm> means a
period of 12 months commencing on 1 July.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_60f22059-b24e-4c74-90f9-b4314b0860bb"
id="sec.3-def.RoadsFund"><b><i>Roads Fund</i></b></defterm> means the TfNSW
Fund established under the <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown"
refid="act-1988-109"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Transport Administration Act
1988</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></deflist>
</block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 3:</b> Am 1996 No 54,
Sch 1 [1]; 1998 No 71, Sch 1 [2]; 2011 No 41, Sch 5.43 [1] [2]; 2020 No 30,
Sch 4.83[1] [2].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3A">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c589415d-438c-45aa-be1f-11d2b191d836"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3A"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3A</no><heading guid="_c4302c2a-c125-4f14-8547-46e0d7e78732"
id="sec.3A-he"><b>Standing appropriation of percentage of certain taxes paid
on petroleum products</b></heading></head>

<pre type="auto-inserted">

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3A-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_293595cc-d0d1-4b98-a7d4-e6287fc25679"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3A-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">There is appropriated by this section each
financial year for payment out of the Consolidated Fund into the Roads Fund an
amount equal to 44.5% of the net petroleum products revenue of the State
during that financial year.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3A-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2453623a-933f-4cab-aa2b-270cc7a58c4e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3A-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The net petroleum products revenue of the State
during a financial year is the amount that the Treasurer determines has been
paid, during that year, to the State by the Commonwealth under the <legref
type="act" jurisd="CTH" check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>States Grants
(General Purposes) Act 1994</i></name></legref> of the Commonwealth as revenue
replacement payments for petroleum business franchise licence fees, less the
amount that the Treasurer determines has been paid during that financial year
by way of State petroleum subsidies.</txt></block></tier>
</pre>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3A-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_572bca4e-737e-41b1-803a-cd52c1d70400"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3A-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">An amount appropriated by this section is to be
rounded to the nearest $1,000.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3A-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cd5e0515-08bd-401f-8b00-2f161ab53d6a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3A-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The appropriation made by this section extends to
the period commencing 5 August 1997. The first financial year to which this
section applies is taken to be the period commencing on 5 August 1997 and
ending on 30 June 1998.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3A-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_730a2aa4-e164-45b2-a378-d741e954c889"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3A-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A determination made by the Treasurer for the
purposes of this section is conclusive.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3A-ssec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0e43122a-ba96-472b-b4b6-52d5e06ca082"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3A-ssec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(6)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Payments to the Roads Fund in respect of an
appropriation under this section are to be made in such instalments and at
such times as the Treasurer determines. Any such payments may be made before
the end of the financial year to which that appropriation relates, subject to
any necessary adjustment at the end of that financial
year.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3A-ssec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a99ca6e5-eed1-451f-8e5f-c6165bf9fd1c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3A-ssec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(7)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_76bab9e7-3928-4eb0-856b-9d509a18ffcf"
id="sec.3A-ssec.7-def.petroleumbusinessfranchiselicencefees"><b><i>petroleum
business franchise licence fees</i></b></defterm> means the fees previously
payable under the <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Business Franchise Licences (Petroleum Products) Act
1987</i></name></legref>.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_5fa8e801-2ddc-42ed-80b4-c1405b4e1b85"
id="sec.3A-ssec.7-def.Statepetroleumsubsidies"><b><i>State petroleum
subsidies</i></b></defterm> means subsidies paid under the <legref type="act"
jurisd="NSW" check="unknown" refid="act-1997-112"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Petroleum Products Subsidy Act 1997</i></name></legref>,
including ex gratia payments generally of the nature authorised by that
Act.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 3A:</b> Ins 1998 No 71,
Sch 1 [3].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4" status="repealed">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_de4f7598-ea6e-44c8-89dc-bd86ecc1e79f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib>
<attrib name="status" value="repealed"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no></head>
<repealed><repealedtxt></repealedtxt></repealed>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 4:</b> Am 1991 No 43,
