</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_382d4ad2-0f7e-4b9a-bff3-86d3e42066fe"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_1ca16ab1-adff-485c-9875-b3dfa3766faf"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Appropriated money subject to statutory trust for road
funding</b></heading></head>

<pre type="auto-inserted">

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_28041780-b686-4a1e-a361-c3acdf6009ff"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The amount paid into the Roads Fund under section
3A is subject to a statutory trust for the funding of road improvement, road
safety and road related public transport infrastructure and must be used by
Transport for NSW accordingly.</txt></block></tier>
</pre>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1464b380-6d0b-4589-b892-55e90f28a8b8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without limiting the generality of subsection
(1), the funding of road improvement, road safety and road related public
transport infrastructure includes the funding of the following&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3f5e9ead-78ac-4031-9944-0e764a44c7aa" id="sec.5-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the construction, improvement, maintenance,
repair and lighting of public roads in the State (including any road that is a
tollway within the meaning of the <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW"
check="unknown" refid="act-1993-033"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Roads Act
1993</i></name></legref>),</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d5cef36c-1471-483e-b336-92f2ec8ad013" id="sec.5-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">any purpose reasonably incidental to a purpose
referred to in paragraph (a), including (but not limited to) the paving,
kerbing and guttering of roads, the planting of trees, lawns and gardens, the
construction of special crossings and footways and the construction of drains
and sewers,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_624f6767-a8b0-40d7-aeef-5e35d701ba68" id="sec.5-ssec.2-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the provision, improvement, maintenance and
repair of traffic control facilities (within the meaning of the <legref
type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown" refid="act-1993-033"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Roads Act 1993</i></name></legref>),</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_988a693e-ddd6-4ddd-95a2-8e4f2400df17" id="sec.5-ssec.2-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the advancement and encouragement of road safety,
including by the funding of education programs concerned with road
safety,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_5fefd15e-f527-48a8-b2fa-d71a479c550f" id="sec.5-ssec.2-para1.d1">
<no>(d1)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">road related public transport infrastructure that
is designed to benefit the road network by increasing transport alternatives
to private vehicle use, by providing for improvements to road related public
transport facilities or by assisting in the integration of different passenger
transport systems,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_5008f06a-e86f-4e48-a411-3a83f87314e8" id="sec.5-ssec.2-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the granting of financial assistance to a council
(within the meaning of the <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown"
refid="act-1993-030"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Local Government Act
1993</i></name></legref>) for the purpose of defraying costs incurred or to be
incurred by the council in doing anything referred to in any of the foregoing
paragraphs.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2A">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4ee5c2ed-d9cf-48e7-857c-44183fcd68e9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2A"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2A)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A reference in this section to road related
public transport infrastructure includes a reference to&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2703dc4d-9573-4e33-a0ad-e20dee0ac014" id="sec.5-ssec.2A-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">dedicated bus lanes, transit lanes, cycleways and
facilities for high occupancy vehicles, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9914dd34-2f2e-471c-823d-ed92c8e65be1" id="sec.5-ssec.2A-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">bus facilities and bus shelters,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_4663fa20-9c66-4ed1-a7b2-7a2fd218cd27" id="sec.5-ssec.2A-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">technologies to facilitate public transport road
operations, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7f1de9ae-97c7-420c-8265-1be1a18082b2" id="sec.5-ssec.2A-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">transport interchanges, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c7fccf93-d5f8-4828-92ba-c64ee50d5b9c" id="sec.5-ssec.2A-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">off-road parking facilities adjacent to major
arterial roads, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d944bf4f-d034-41e5-aa7d-661f7bede8fa" id="sec.5-ssec.2A-para1.f">
<no>(f)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">commuter parking, bus facilities and bicycle
lockers at railway stations, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9b13ec3b-a4f0-44db-8f5a-3135d46634f6" id="sec.5-ssec.2A-para1.g">
<no>(g)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">bus, bicycle and pedestrian access to railway
stations, transport interchanges and major residential, recreational,
commercial and industrial centres.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_eeaac54b-a4fb-46ee-ad5e-3d8d7bec6aec"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Transport for NSW is authorised by this section
to exercise any of its functions under the <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW"
check="unknown" refid="act-1988-109"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Transport
Administration Act 1988</i></name></legref> and any other Act for the purpose
of road improvement, road safety and road related public transport
infrastructure and the functions of Transport for NSW include the power to do
anything described in any of the paragraphs of subsection
(2).</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 5:</b> Am 1993 No 33,
Sch 1; 1995 No 11, Sch 1; 1995 No 15, Sch 1 [3]&#8211;[7]; 1998 No 71, Sch 1
[5]; 2020 No 30, Sch 4.83[3].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_92d6b02d-e557-4154-abec-58bf6a40e251"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_87097950-08df-4c92-aae5-f139ff75d9d4"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Decisions concerning road funding</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In deciding how money is to be applied in
accordance with the statutory trust under section 5, regard shall be had to
the following matters&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_5c033120-b7d5-4276-9b02-171c9f74518d" id="sec.6-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the need for the benefits that flow from
expenditure to exceed the expenditure involved,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6582c080-57e7-48ae-925b-dff9f9b47396" id="sec.6-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the need for safe roads and the need to encourage
road safety,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d1d397ac-78a2-4676-b9d7-12742ee5445f" id="sec.6-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the need for roads that will increase the
competitiveness of industries in the State, particularly industries producing
goods for export or goods that will compete with imports on the Australian
market,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_1f1da2d9-5469-4c55-a3f6-ea5e4dcac018" id="sec.6-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the need for roads that will facilitate and
encourage travel in the State for tourist purposes,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_036de2b2-bd0f-4f39-857f-8113bfefd58a" id="sec.6-para1.e">
<no>(e)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the need to improve road network
efficiency,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_308c803f-a90c-42eb-9049-c132e2440b5d" id="sec.6-para1.f">
<no>(f)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the need to reduce road maintenance
costs,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d4a76baf-74d4-4c05-ac19-89379608724f" id="sec.6-para1.g">
<no>(g)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the need to preserve the integrity of
communities,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_97fc8d51-1860-42a3-91a9-05ad576242af" id="sec.6-para1.h">
<no>(h)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the need to develop and improve the efficient and
effective operations of transport interchanges,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_47837826-dce7-4ee4-a4c6-9a90cd4addff" id="sec.6-para1.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the need to provide alternative off-road parking
facilities adjacent to major arterial roads to enable bus lanes and transit
lanes to be created,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a11f0bb5-5167-4927-b428-c9bc31215eb8" id="sec.6-para1.j">
<no>(j)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the need to improve the efficiency of movement of
public transport along major arterial roads.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>

<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 6:</b> Am 1995 No 15,
Sch 1 [8].</txt></content>
</level>
</content>


